OL,3,AArticle: published on 22 September 2026
OL,4,
OL,5,FIn the expansive grasslands of Inner
OL,6,FMongolia, farmers are picking plump
OL,7,Fpotatoes alongside new neighbours:
OL,8,Fhuge, rectangular blocks that will fuel
OL,9,FChina's AI platforms.
OL,11,FUlanqab, with its steppes and
OL,12,Fvolcanoes, is an unlikely digital
OL,13,Ffrontier. For years, it has been
OL,14,FChina's official "potato capital". But
OL,15,Fnow its fields have also become
OL,16,Fconstruction sites for a slew of data
OL,17,Fcentres, as Donald Trump and his
OL,18,FChinese counterpart Xi Jinping meet to
OL,19,Fdiscuss AI safety among other things.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,109,105,200,160,0,100
