OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F108A1790135656
OL,1,W5j 5Q#7!wsj#%uzj#57kj  7kjc1uz
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,AArticle: published on 22 September 2026
OL,4,
OL,5,FHundreds of workers in yellow helmets
OL,6,Fcarry heavy equipment into the building
OL,7,Fsite as welding sparks fly off metal
OL,8,Fscaffolding. Above them huge cranes
OL,9,Fmove with precision to build rooftops,
OL,10,Fwhile men balance on ladders to plaster
OL,11,Fbrickwork.
OL,13,F"This is China speed," jokes one
OL,14,Fworker. "An infrastructure maniac," is
OL,15,Fhow he describes his country, laughing
OL,16,Fas he walks away. "There is one phase
OL,17,Fevery year. This is the second phase,"
OL,18,Fexplains an electrical engineer. "There
OL,19,Fwill be many more phases afterwards."
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
